{
  "headline": "Guardiola expected back at Etihad as City appeal continues",
  "summary": "BBC Sport reports that Pep Guardiola is expected to attend Manchester City’s home match against Paris St-Germain on 14 October. It would be his first return to the Etihad since leaving at the end of last season. The visit comes while City appeal an independent commission’s findings on breaches of Premier League financial rules; the club denies wrongdoing. Before that European fixture, City resume their league campaign away at Liverpool on Sunday.",
